# HTTP check by touch
title Net Toolbox: HTTP check by touch
sizes 640x480 800x480 720x720 1024x600 1280x720
env NET_TOOLBOX_DEMO http=ok,http_url=https://example.com
env NET_TOOLBOX_FIXTURE deck
env NET_TOOLBOX_LOG_DIR /tmp/nt-scene-logs
key down
key down
key down
key down
key down
wait 400
tap "HTTP check"
shot page
wait 400
@640x480 tapxy 0.5 0.254
@800x480 tapxy 0.5 0.24
@720x720 tapxy 0.5 0.18
@1024x600 tapxy 0.5 0.20
@1280x720 tapxy 0.5 0.19
shot result
expect text "200 OK"
tap "Esc"
